      en: ["The town is strategically located on the Offin River.", "Dunkwa is the administrative center of Upper Denkyira East.", "Industrial gold mining began in the area around 1900.", "The region is a leading producer of cocoa in Ghana.", "The town has a population of approximately 33,000 residents.", "It serves as a significant railway junction for freight."],
