      en: ["Nkoranza is a major center for maize production in Ghana.", "The town is located in the Bono East Region.", "The nearby Boabeng-Fiema Monkey Sanctuary is world-famous.", "Nkoranza is the seat of the Nkoranza Traditional Council.", "The region produces significant quantities of tobacco for export.", "The town serves as a key market for traders from the north."],
      es: ["Nkoranza es un centro principal para el cultivo de maíz en Ghana.", "La ciudad está situada en la región de Bono East.", "El cercano santuario de monos Boabeng-Fiema es mundialmente famoso.", "Nkoranza es la sede del Consejo Tradicional de Nkoranza.", "La región produce grandes cantidades de tabaco para la exportación.", "La ciudad sirve como mercado importante para comerciantes del norte."],
