      en: ["Anloga is the ceremonial and traditional capital of the Anlo State.", "The town is recognized as Ghana’s leading center for shallot cultivation.", "Anloga is positioned on a sandbar between the Atlantic and Keta Lagoon.", "The Hogbetsotso Festival is celebrated on the first Saturday of November.", "The town hosts the prestigious Anlo Senior High School.", "Historically, Anloga was a renowned center for weaving and Kente production."],
